the you I've come to know.If a face could launch a thousand ships,Then where am I to go?There's no one home but you,You're all that's left me too.And when my love for life is running dry,You come and pour yourself on me.If a man could be two places at one time,I'd be with you.Tomorrow and today, beside you all the way.If the world should stop revolving spinning slowly down to die,I'd spend the end with you.And when the world was through,Then one by one the stars would all go out,Then you and I would simply fly away.IF.[2;37;0m[1;31m但愿人长久，千里共婵娟。[2;37;0m[2;37;0m",]),(["title":"有爱就有光明","msg":"世间的关系，总是由亲近而开始，淡漠而结束。心和心的距离，在一个呼吸间变幻莫测。近和远，产生于一个念头的力量。因爱存在，所以有了关心、照顾、分担、包容、帮助！也因爱存在，所以有了埋怨、占有、 要求、伤害、排斥、淡漠…… 世界最近的距离，最远的距离，皆因爱而生！即便如此，心里还是要保留爱的温暖！有爱就有光明早安！[1;36m 我是天青，想你！请留言！[2;37;0m[2;37;0m","time":1372286626,"author":"天青","owner":"samesame",]),(["title":"回复：一首特别适合网络恋人的歌","msg":"[36m> ◎小野百合 在 06/26/2013 22:05 留下这篇留言：[36m> [36m[36m> If a picture paints a thousand words,[36m> Then why can't I paint you?[36m> The words will never show the you I've come to know.[36m> If a face could launch a thousand ships,[36m> Then where am I to go?[36m> There's no one home but you,[36m> You're all that's left me too.[36m> And when my love for life is running dry,[36m> You come and pour yourself on me.[36m> If a man could be two places at one time,[36m> I'd be with you.[36m> Tomorrow and today, beside you all the way.[36m> If the world should stop revolving spinning slowly down to die,[36m> I'd spend the end with you.[36m> And when the world was through,[36m> Then one by one the stars would all go out,[36m> Then you and I would simply fly away.[36m> IF.[36m> [2;37;0m[36m> [1;31m但愿人长久，千里共婵娟。[2;37;0m[36m> [2;37;0m◎小麦棵(mike) 在 06/26/2013 22:05 留下这篇留言：啥意思求翻译laugh[2;37;0m","time":1372362689,"author":"小麦棵","owner":"mike",]),(["title":"估计不是干好事去了","msg":"红莲老祖(redl)脸上露出邪恶的笑容，不知道哪里想歪了。 * grin 红莲老祖(redl)向大家挥了挥手，